From d733c456f1e494e3652955d42b71b6db0e49a2a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 18:51:37 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 14: deliver bounded isolated-world page
 messages

Inject a bounded JSON sender only into installed boost or explicitly evaluated isolated worlds. Validate primary-frame context, profile/document identity, rate and queue limits, with stale delivery cancellation and callback registration generations. Preserve surviving world identities after aborted navigation. Add isolated_page_messages in ABI 1.9.

Last rebased: 2026-11-02 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
